<title>GERMANY: FAG Kugelfischer group net profit rises.</title>
<headline>FAG Kugelfischer group net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SCHWEINFURT, Germany 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   106     vs 101</p>
<p>    Group earnings per share		 1.75    vs 1.84 marks</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German ball-bearings manufacturer is FAG Kugelfischer AG.  </p>
<p>    Group cash flow			    248     vs 225</p>
<p>    Group investment			   183     vs 159</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities    166     vs 113</p>
<p>    Group workforce			    16,226  vs 15,985</p>
<p>    Group sales				  2,987   vs 2,890</p>
<p>    Dividend				     50 pfgs vs 40 pfgs</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
